  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.9,
      556.07,
      286.56,
      724.91
    ],
    "text": "Details of the land or servitude to be acquired. Allotment in Total extent 1.8670 Hectares of Cadastral Map No. 910358, situated in the Village of Mankumban, in Grama Niladhari Division of J/11 Mankumban - in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Island South, Velanai in the District of Jaffna in Northern Province. Purpose of Acquisition : For the Construction of Allaipiddi New water purification wells and acquisition of land in which has constructed pump houses, old purification wells and water tower under Jaffna - Kilinochchi Water Supply and Sanitation Project of National Water Supply and Drainage Board.",
