  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      57.5,
      116.79,
      294.88,
      233.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land / lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat of Island South, Velanai on the 26th day of January, 2026 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 12th day of January 2026 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land /servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
